    text sum_b "вари́ два́дцать мину́т" say "вари́ два́дцать мину́т" x 500 y 330 font_size 56 hidden true

A: You can buy хлеб, (@draw market@) сыр and мя́со at the market. But how do you cook with them in Russian?
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name o_bread o_cheese o_meat

A: Tom and Masha (@draw kitchen@) are на ку́хне, at Masha's, and today (@highlight masha_name color #c9871a effect underline@) Masha gives the orders.

    erase o_bread o_cheese o_meat market kitchen

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

B: Карто́шка. Яйцо́, (@draw w_egg ends@) и я́йца. (@draw w_eggs ends@)
    draw i_pot w_pot i_egg

A: Potatoes, an egg; and many eggs are я́йца, with the stress jumping to the front.
    highlight w_eggs color #c9871a effect underline

B: Ма́сло и соль. (@draw w_salt ends@)
    draw i_but w_but i_salt

A: Ма́сло is butter, or oil. Соль, salt, is an она́ word, though it ends in a soft sign.
    highlight w_salt color #c9871a effect underline

    erase i_pot w_pot i_egg w_egg w_eggs i_but w_but i_salt w_salt

B: Я варю́ суп. (@draw v_knife v_rez@) Я ре́жу хлеб.
    draw v_pot v_var

A: Варю́: I'm boiling, or cooking. Ре́жу: I'm cutting. (@draw v_inf@) The verbs are вари́ть and ре́зать.

    erase v_pot v_var v_knife v_rez v_inf

A: A recipe (@draw memo@) is a row of jobs, each done to the end; so, as in lesson sixty-six, (@draw r_head@) its commands take the done verb.

    erase memo

B: Свари́ карто́шку!
    draw x1

A: Свари́ть (@draw d1@) is вари́ть's done verb, with с in front: сварю́, I'll boil it. And like напишу́, напиши́, (@highlight d1 color #3d8a5a part и́$@) сварю́ gives свари́.

B: Наре́жь хлеб! Доба́вь соль!
    draw x23

A: Наре́зать (@draw d2@) is to cut it all up, with на in front. Доба́вить, (@draw d3@) to add, is a done verb as it stands.

A: Their requests end in a soft sign, like не забу́дь, because the я form isn't stressed on the end: наре́жу, доба́влю.
    highlight d2 d3 color #3d8a5a part ь$

A: And доба́влю drops its л: доба́вь.
    highlight d3 color #c9871a part л effect underline

    quiz "Tell a friend to add the butter. Pick one." store chk voice b
        right: Доба́вь: доба́влю isn't stressed on the end, so the request ends in ь.
        wrong: Доба́влю is I'll add. The request ends in a soft sign.
        * Доба́влю ма́сло.
        + Доба́вь ма́сло!
        * Доба́вил ма́сло.

    erase r_head x1 d1 x23 d2 d3

A: But (@draw clock@) a recipe also says how long.

B: Вари́ два́дцать мину́т!
    draw long1

A: Twenty minutes of boiling is keeping at it, so the doing verb: вари́, not свари́.
    highlight long1 color #c9871a part Вари́ effect underline

A: Мину́та, a minute, counts like час, but two (@draw mins@) is две, (@highlight mins color #c9871a part две effect underline@) not два: две мину́ты. After five, an а word has no ending at all, (@highlight mins color #c9871a part "пять мину́т" effect underline@) as in мно́го мам: пять мину́т.

    erase clock long1 mins

A: Now Tom asks Masha how long the eggs take. Listen.
    draw l_egg

A: Ма́ша, ско́лько вари́ть я́йца?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    draw balloon

    ask "How long should the eggs boil?" voice b options ["ten minutes","two minutes","twelve minutes"] correct 1 reveal.text "Вари́ я́йца де́сять мину́т." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 280 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833
        gloss: Boil the eggs for ten minutes.
        listen: Вари́ я́йца де́сять мину́т.
        right: Ten minutes: де́сять мину́т.
        wrong: Listen for the number before мину́т.

    erase l_egg balloon balloon_t question_2_stamp

    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Now the whole job, на ку́хне. Listen, then practise it.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw q_bread

    quiz "Tell a friend to cut up all the bread: ___ хлеб! Which fits?" above q_bread reveal.text "Наре́жь хлеб!" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Наре́жь: one job, done, so the done verb's request.
        wrong: A request, and the whole loaf: the done verb, ending in ь.
        * Ре́жу
        + Наре́жь
        * Наре́жу

    erase q_bread

    draw q_clock

    quiz "Tell a friend: boil it for ten minutes. ___ де́сять мину́т! Which fits?" above q_clock reveal.text "Вари́ де́сять мину́т!" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Вари́: ten minutes of boiling, so the doing verb.
        wrong: How long is keeping at it: the doing verb.
        + Вари́
        * Свари́

    erase q_clock

    draw q_five

    quiz "Пять ___. Which word?" above q_five reveal.text "пять мину́т" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Мину́т: after five, no ending at all.
        wrong: Like час, часа́, часо́в: five takes the third form.
        * мину́та
        * мину́ты
        + мину́т

    erase q_five

    draw q_but q_salt

    ask "Your turn: tell a friend to add butter and salt." say_it "Доба́вь ма́сло и соль." gloss "Add butter and salt." voice b show cue test t1

B: Доба́вь ма́сло и соль.
    draw q_say

    erase q_but q_salt q_say

    draw q_egg q_salt2

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type, to a friend: Boil the eggs and add salt!" above ["q_egg","q_salt2"] answer ["свари яйца и добавь соль","свари яйца и добавь соли"] reveal.text "Свари́ я́йца и доба́вь соль!" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Свари́ я́йца и доба́вь соль: two jobs, each done once, so two done verbs.
        wrong: Two jobs to finish: свари́ я́йца, then и доба́вь соль.

    erase q_egg q_salt2

    draw score_pot

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_pot

A: So a (@draw sum_h1 sum_a@) recipe is done verbs, one job each: свари́, наре́жь, доба́вь; and for (@draw sum_h2 sum_b@) how long, the doing verb: вари́ два́дцать мину́т.

    erase sum_h1 sum_h2 sum_a sum_b

B: Свари́ карто́шку, и не забу́дь соль! Пока́!
    icon end_pot size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["pot of food"] icon_look picture of potato
    text end_say "Не забу́дь соль! Пока́!" say "Не забу́дь соль! Пока́!" say_voice b x 500 y 300 font_size 64

    erase end_pot end_say

A: Next time: a Russian restaurant, and принеси́те.
    box next74 "Next: lesson 74 · принеси́те" say принеси́те x 500 y 430 width 680 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

